<title>NORWAY: SOCCER-ROSENBORG V JUVENTUS TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROSENBORG V JUVENTUS TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's European Cup quarter-final meeting between Norway's Rosenborg and Italy's Juventus.</p>
<p>Rosenborg - 1-Joern Jamtfall, 3-Erik Hoftun, 5-Staale Stensaas, 6-Roar Strand, 8-Bent Skammelsrud, 11-Mini Jakobsen, 14-Vegard Heggem, 15-Jon Olav Hjelde, 20-Trond Egil Soltvedt, 26-Sigurd Rushfeldt, 27-Andre Bergdoelmo.</p>
<p>Juventus - 1-Angelo Peruzzi, 3-Moreno Torricelli, 4-Paolo Montero, 2-Ciro Ferrara, 13-Mark Juliano, 7-Angelo Di Livio, 21-Zinedine Zidane, 14-Didier Deschamps, 18-Vladimir Jugovic, 11-Michele Padovano, 15-Christian Vieri.</p>
</text>
